# The service and console images build from the repository root
# (infra/local/docker-compose.yml), so the whole checkout is the build context.
# Without this, the daemon was sent node_modules, a scratch install's
# install.json and secrets (.scratch/), and the work directories; and `COPY
# packages`, `COPY apps/<x>` and `COPY config` copied whatever untracked file sat
# inside them (apps/console/.env.local, an install's config/models.yaml) into
# an image that is then pushed to a registry. Each image builds what it needs
# inside itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.scratch
.ci
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
**/work
**/logs
**/*.log
.git
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
config/models.yaml
